            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1333] shift-enter in textbox of dynamic form runs the cell twice</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1333</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
