                            <comment id="15423930" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 17 Aug 2016 05:41:14 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user corneadoug opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1337&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1337&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

